sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Import provenance without a runtime HSM dependency
accDescr: The existing HSM generates key material that is securely wrapped and imported into an EXTERNAL-origin KMS key. Subsequent S3 operations use KMS without a call to the original HSM.
participant H as Existing HSM
participant A as Key administrator
participant K as AWS KMS
participant S as Amazon S3
A->>K: Create EXTERNAL key and obtain import parameters
K-->>A: Wrapping public key and import token
A->>H: Generate and securely wrap key material
H-->>A: Wrapped key material
A->>K: Import wrapped material and token
Note over H,K: Setup transfers a protected copy
S->>K: SSE-KMS data key operation
K-->>S: Cryptographic result
Note over H,S: Routine S3 operations do not call the HSM
